=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Rigobertine}, {z:Eastern Adoulin} (J-7) outside the Order of Weatherspoon. You will receive a {k:Purple purgation cloth} Key Item.
** {p:Waypoint} {z:Eastern Adoulin} Castle Adoulin gates
* Click the **Suspicious Roots** at (G-6) in {z:Yorcia Weald} for a cutscene. This is an open area with Leafkin & Opo-opo.
** From Bivouac #1 head North/NW, take the first right heading North, then take the first left heading North.
** Close to the Ergon Locus "Pool of Clarity"
* Select the Suspicious Roots again to enter a BCNM with a {p:Dullahan|Category:Dullahan} {p:NM}, {m:Headless Torturer}.
** All Party members must have a Purple purgation cloth to enter fight.
*** Party members who have already completed the quest do not need the key item and just need to be in the same zone as the leader.
** {p:Trusts|Trust} may be summoned inside this fight.
** Ingrid will assist you during the fight. If she is defeated, you will lose the fight immediately.
** {m:Headless Torturer} uses all standard {p:Dullahan|Category:Dullahan} TP Moves as well as Tier V single target, AoE Elemental and Enfeebling magic spells.
** If you are defeated, speak with {n:Rigobertine} to obtain a new Key Item in order to try again.
* Upon victory, examine the **Suspicious Roots** again for the last cutscene, and your rewards.

